0..80 Comment "//! A flow between list types by a translator that recurses into the tail, after"
81..104 Comment "//! directed univalence"
105..176 Comment "//! [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory],"
177..254 Comment "//! Definition 1.2: at one cell the image binds the translator\'s own image of"
255..329 Comment "//! the rigid tail, and the cell it returns over that image and the head\'s"
330..396 Comment "//! leaves is natural, so the translator is natural at every list."
397..400 Comment "//!"
